%N A400407 E.g.f. A(x) satisfies A(x) = 1/(1 - x*A(x))^(x^3*A(x)^3).
%H A400407 <a href="/index/Res#revert">Index entries for reversions of series</a>
%F A400407 E.g.f.: (1/x) * Series_Reversion( x*(1 - x)^(x^3) ).
%F A400407 a(n) = n! * Sum_{k=0..floor(n/4)} (n+1)^(k-1) * |Stirling1(n-3*k,k)|/(n-3*k)!.
%o A400407 (PARI) a(n) = n!*sum(k=0, n\4, (n+1)^(k-1)*abs(stirling(n-3*k, k, 1))/(n-3*k)!);
